During testing, immediately after the main value was actuated, the pressure in the injector manifold
increased to the setpoint based on the tank ullage pressure as shown in Figure 4-3. The injector manifold
pressure resulted in a specific mass flow rate. The initial start-up ramp was found to be 600 ms. This


