The SAFFIRE injector design was modelled using commercial CFD software, Star CCM+. The
objective was to aid the design phase and to determine the predicted performance of the injector. The
full methods and results of the simulations have been published by Martin (2019) who conducted
separate simulations to determine the performance of the fuel and oxidiser domains with the fluids set
