7. Experimental and Simulation Results
7.1 Introduction
The data obtained through the experimental methods described in Chapter 5 were compared to the
updated simulation results. A direct comparison between the results could be made due to the simulation
updates and calibration procedures described in Chapters 4 and 5. The data collected contained the
uncertainties documented in Chapter 6. The modelled pressure drop, flow factor and propellant
